<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Western Australia score 235 for six.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Western Australia score 235 for six.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australia scored 235 for six in 50 overs against West Indies in their limited overs tour match at the WACA Ground on Thursday.</p>
<p>Score - Western Australia 235 for six in 50 overs (Justin Langer 79, Mike Hussey 56).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
